{
  "_about": "Module registry for asiabo.py (run.bat). Edit via the menu (t = tweak args, a = add, r = remove) or by hand. est_min / ram_gb are first guesses; the dashboard shows the learned value from runs.csv once a module has run. 'steps' = commands run in order (stops at the first failure); 'delete_after' = temp files removed when the module ends; 'tidy_after' = bats a script re-writes by itself, moved to old versions\\bats after the run; 'confirm' = asked before running.",
